					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13968115#post-4860937</guid>
				<title>I know what my signature says, but...</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13968115/scp-5161#post-4860937</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 03 Jan 2021 09:15:53 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>ISNorden</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6966599</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Having an anomalous low-tech game with built-in auto-cheating? Makes sense.</p> <p>Using the player's muscle mass to repair damage to itself? Makes less sense for a game that depends mainly on hand-eye coordination; I'd have this skip inflict similar neurological damage, worsening vision and motor/manual skills instead of taking a literal pound of flesh.</p> 
				 	]]>
